    {
      "id": "blk-0100",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "【考情分析】本章每年分值16-18分，福特制和汽车产业是高频考点。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
