    {
      "id": "blk-0101",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "text": "核心考点一：电气时代核心技术集群（★★★★★）",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0102",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "电力：柔性动力，电动机使工厂布局解放，催生家电产业",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0103",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "西门子发电机（1866）、爱迪生珍珠街电站（1882）",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0104",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "内燃机：使个体自由移动成为可能，催生汽车产业",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0105",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "奥托四冲程发动机、本茨与戴姆勒汽车",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0106",
      "type": "list_item",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "新材料：合成塑料（酚醛树脂）解放产品形态",
